# Hydra Controls — Cedar Ridge Engineering Toolkit

Stdlib-only Python 3 utilities for talking to the Cedar Ridge field
controllers from the engineering workstation. No third-party packages.

| Tool | Protocol | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `pcom_client.py` | Unitronics PCOM/TCP (ASCII, protocol 101), tcp/20256 | V570 chemical feed: MI/MB 0-4095, PLC RUN/STOP |
| `mbtool.py` | Modbus/TCP, tcp/502 | all three controllers: coils/DI/HR/IR, FC43 device id, FC17 server id |
| `tagmon.py` | Modbus/TCP, tcp/502 | live tag monitor for a chosen site |
| `mbclient.py` | — | shared Modbus/TCP client library imported by the tools |

Controllers:

```
{{ ww_net }}.50.10   ww-plc01  Cedar River Intake PS-1 (Modicon M340)
{{ ww_net }}.50.20   ww-plc02  WTP Chemical Feed (Unitronics V570, Modbus + PCOM)
{{ ww_net }}.50.30   ww-rtu03  Hilltop Booster PS-3 (SCADAPack 474)
```

## pcom_client.py (Unitronics V570)

The Modbus gateway on the V570 only exposes MI/MB **0-999**. The commissioning
note at **MI 3000-3023** and the controller **RUN/STOP** state are reachable
**only** over PCOM/TCP. This tool is the only way to touch them.

```
pcom_client.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 id                 # model + RUN/STOP
pcom_client.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 rw 3000 24 --text  # read commissioning note
pcom_client.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 rw 0 13            # PLANT_FLOW .. DOSE_MODE
pcom_client.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 sw 1 120           # NAOH_DOSE_SP = 120 ppm
pcom_client.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 rb 0 4             # read MB 0..3
pcom_client.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 sb 2 0             # clear PH_HIHI_CUTOUT_EN
pcom_client.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 stop               # CCS: PLC -> STOP
pcom_client.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 run                # CCR: PLC -> RUN
```

## mbtool.py (Modbus/TCP)

```
mbtool.py {{ ww_net }}.50.10 devid              # FC43 Read Device Identification
mbtool.py {{ ww_net }}.50.10 devid --code 4 --obj 6  # single object (UserApplicationName)
mbtool.py {{ ww_net }}.50.10 srvid              # FC17 Report Server ID
mbtool.py {{ ww_net }}.50.10 ri 0 12            # intake input registers
mbtool.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 rh 900 24 --text   # V570 panel message (Modbus window)
mbtool.py {{ ww_net }}.50.30 rh 20 3            # rtu03 maint key / mode / timer
mbtool.py {{ ww_net }}.50.30 wh 2 500           # FCV301_SP = 50.0 %
```

## tagmon.py

```
tagmon.py {{ ww_net }}.50.10 intake
tagmon.py {{ ww_net }}.50.20 chemfeed -i 2
tagmon.py {{ ww_net }}.50.30 booster -n 5
```

## projbackup

Before editing a live PLC program, snapshot the project tree:

```
projbackup        # writes /var/backups/projects.tgz
```

